### Estado API
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/customers

### Empleados
GET http://localhost:3000/employees

### Productos
GET http://localhost:3000/products

### Consultar orden creada
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/11081

### Crear orden
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "ALFKI",
  "employee_id": 5,
  "order_date": "2026-09-14",
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 3,
      "quantity": 2,
      "discount": 0
    },
    {
      "product_id": 11,
      "quantity": 1,
      "discount": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

### Error: cliente inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "XXXXX",
  "employee_id": 5,
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 3,
      "quantity": 1,
      "discount": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Error: producto inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "ALFKI",
  "employee_id": 5,
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 9999,
      "quantity": 1,
      "discount": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Error: quantity = 0
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "ALFKI",
  "employee_id": 5,
  "products": [
    {
      "product_id": 3,
      "quantity": 0,
      "discount": 0
    }
  ]
}

### Error: products = []
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "ALFKI",
  "employee_id": 5,
  "products": []
}
